# 📘 DARS 8: A B C D E

## 🤖 TalkMe (TTS matni)

> Salom yana! Bugun biz **alifboni** boshlaymiz. Ingliz alifbosida **26 ta harf** bor. Bugun **birinchi 5 tasini** o‘rganamiz: **A, B, C, D, E**. Har bir harfni **ovoz chiqarib** takrorlang. 🚀

## 📖 QOIDA

**A a** — [ey] — **a**pple (olma)
**B b** — [bi] — **b**ook (kitob)
**C c** — [si] — **c**at (mushuk)
**D d** — [di] — **d**og (it)
**E e** — [i] — **e**gg (tuxum)

**Muhim:** Harfning **nomi** bilan **tovushi** boshqacha! A nomi — “ey”, lekin so‘zda “a” tovushi.

**Katta va kichik:** A-a, B-b, C-c, D-d, E-e.

## 💬 MISOLLAR

> **A** — **A**li, **a**pple
> **B** — **B**ob, **b**ook
> **C** — **C**harlie, **c**at
> **D** — **D**avid, **d**og
> **E** — **E**mma, **e**gg

