## ✅ XULOSA

**Bugun:** Present Perfect = have/has + P.P. Natija hozir muhim.

**Ishlatilishi:** Natija, tajriba, since/for, just/already/yet/ever/never.

**Muhim:** Aniq o‘tgan zamon (yesterday, last week) bilan **ishlatilmaydi** — Past Simple ishlatiladi.

**Uyga vazifa:** Bugun 3 ta gap tuzing: “I have...”, “She has...”, “Have you ever...?”

