# 📘 DARS 336: INFINITIVLI NOMINATIV — HE IS SAID TO...

## 🤖 TalkMe (TTS matni)

> Salom yana! Bugun biz **infinitivli nominativ** — “aytishlaricha...” — ni o‘rganamiz. Bu — **akademik** daraja. “**Aytishlaricha** u Londonda yashaydi” — “**He is said to live** in London”. Qo‘rqmang! 🚀

## 📖 QOIDA

**Infinitivli nominativ** — **“aytishlaricha...”, “ma’lumki...”** kabi iboralar.

**Yasalishi:** **Ega + kesim (majhul) + to + fe’l**.

> **He is said to live** in London. — Aytishlaricha u Londonda yashaydi.
> **They are believed to be** on their way. — Ular yo‘lda deb hisoblashadi.
> **The delegation is reported to have left** Tashkent. — Xabar berilishicha delegatsiya Toshkentdan jo‘nab ketgan.

**Qachon ishlatamiz?**
> **It is said that...** kabi ergash gaplarni **sodda** gapga aylantiradi.
> **Rasmiy** va **akademik** tilda.

**Asosiy fe’llar:** say, report, believe, think, expect, know, consider, see, hear.

## 💬 MISOLLAR

> **He is said to live** in Boston. = It is said that he lives in Boston. — Aytishlaricha u Bostonda yashaydi.
> **This plant is known to produce** tractors. = It is known that this plant produces tractors. — Bu zavod traktor ishlab chiqarishi ma’lum.
> **They are believed to be** on their way to Samarkand. — Ularni Samarqandga ketayaptilar deb hisoblashadi.
> **The delegation is reported to have left** Tashkent. — Xabar berilishicha delegatsiya Toshkentdan jo‘nab ketgan.

## ✍️ MASHQ

**1-mashq:** “Aytishlaricha u Londonda yashaydi” → ______ → **✅ He is said to live in London.**

**2-mashq:** “Ular yo‘lda deb hisoblashadi” → ______ → **✅ They are believed to be on their way.**

**3-mashq:** “Xabar berilishicha delegatsiya ketgan” → ______ → **✅ The delegation is reported to have left.**

**4-mashq:** “It is said that he lives in London” ni sodda gapga aylantiring → **✅ He is said to live in London.**

## ✅ XULOSA

**Bugun:** Infinitivli nominativ = Ega + majhul kesim + to + fe’l. “Aytishlaricha...”, “ma’lumki...”.

**Qachon:** It is said that... → sodda gap. Rasmiy va akademik tilda.

**Uyga vazifa:** Bugun 3 ta gap tuzing: “He is said to...”, “They are believed to...”, “She is reported to...”.

