# 📘 DARS 376: INVERSIYA — NEVER HAVE I SEEN

## 🤖 TalkMe (TTS matni)

> Salom yana! Bugun biz **inversiya** — “teskari so‘z tartibi” — ni o‘rganamiz. Bu — **eng yuqori** daraja. “**Umrimda hech qachon** bunday narsani **ko‘rmaganman**” — “**Never have I seen** such a thing”. Qo‘rqmang! 🚀

## 📖 QOIDA

**Inversiya** — teskari so‘z tartibi. Odatda ega kesimdan oldin. Inversiyada **kesim eganing oldiga** o‘tadi.

**Qachon ishlatiladi?**
> **Never, hardly, scarcely, seldom** bilan boshlangan gaplarda: “**Never have I seen** such a thing.”
> **No sooner ... than** bilan: “**No sooner had he arrived than** he fell ill.”
> **Hardly ... when** bilan: “**Hardly had he entered** the house **when** it started to rain.”
> **In vain** bilan: “**In vain did we try** to make him do it.”
> **Shart gaplarda** (if tushib qolganda): “**Had I known**, I would have helped.”

**Muhim:** Inversiyada **yordamchi fe’l** eganing oldiga o‘tadi. Agar yordamchi fe’l bo‘lmasa, **do/does/did** qo‘shiladi.

## 💬 MISOLLAR

> **Never have I seen** such a thing. — Umrimda hech qachon bunday narsani ko‘rmaganman.
> **No sooner had he arrived than** he fell ill. — U yetib kelar-kelmas kasal bo‘lib qoldi.
> **Hardly had he entered** the house **when** it started to rain. — U uyga kirar-kirmas yomg‘ir yog‘a boshladi.
> **In vain did we try** to make him do it. — Behudaga uni bu ishni qilishga majbur qildik.
> **Had I known**, I would have helped. — Agar bilganimda edi, yordam bergan bo‘lardim.

## ✍️ MASHQ

**1-mashq:** “Umrimda bunday narsani ko‘rmaganman” → ______ → **✅ Never have I seen such a thing.**

**2-mashq:** “U yetib kelar-kelmas kasal bo‘lib qoldi” → ______ → **✅ No sooner had he arrived than he fell ill.**

**3-mashq:** “Agar bilganimda edi, yordam bergan bo‘lardim” → ______ → **✅ Had I known, I would have helped.**

**4-mashq:** “I have never seen such a thing” ni inversiya bilan yozing → **✅ Never have I seen such a thing.**

## ✅ XULOSA

**Bugun:** Inversiya = teskari so‘z tartibi. Kesim eganing oldiga o‘tadi.

**Qachon:** Never, hardly, scarcely, seldom, no sooner...than, in vain, shart gaplarda (if tushganda).

**Muhim:** Yordamchi fe’l oldinga. Bo‘lmasa — do/does/did.

**Uyga vazifa:** Bugun 3 ta gap tuzing: “Never have I...”, “No sooner had...”, “Had I known...”.

